  "rules": [
    "No screening of primary colours — use the Sapphire set for lighter and darker steps.",
    "Never mix two colour sets in one asset.",
    "No gradients, including chart fills and button states.",
    "No colours outside the brand sets, including opacity-derived greys.",
    "Dark tiers are not layout backgrounds, except digital surfaces where Sapphire Dark is the reading background.",
    "Red is Finacle only.",
    "Tier discipline: Ultra Light for backgrounds and illustration, Light for Portals and illustration, Medium for the Activation Portal, backgrounds and call-outs, Dark for typography, line art and logos.",
    "AA is the floor, with three named exceptions — see accessibility.exceptions.",
    "White is the type colour on any coloured ground.",
    "Judge large text at rendered size, not authored size.",
    "Never rely on colour alone to carry meaning.",
    "Never recreate, re-trace, re-colour or re-proportion any logo."
